SUMMARY:CIGRE Symposium 2027: Synopsis upload (23:59 UTC+12 (assumed))
DESCRIPTION:CIGRE International Symposium (CIGRE Symposium 2027)\n\nSynopsi
 s upload: 11 Jan 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nConference: November 8-1
