 ention Center (QSNCC)\n\nAll dates:\n  Synopsis upload: 11 Jan 2027\, 23:5
 9 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Selection of synopses by SCs: 14 Feb 2027\, 23:59 UT
 C+12 (assumed)\n  Full paper upload: 25 Jul 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\
 n  Feedback to authors of full papers: 12 Sept 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assume
 d)\n  Final papers: 26 Sept 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  Final papers 
 on ConfTool: 10 Oct 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n  PowerPoint presentati
 on: 24 Oct 2027\, 23:59 UTC+12 (assumed)\n\nThe call for papers states no 
