 \, so the countdown runs out before the real deadline rather than after it
 .\n\nTheme "Shaping the Future of Grids – Resilience\, Intelligence\, an
 d Innovation for the Energy Transition"\, hosted by CIGRE Thailand. The sy
 nopsis portal opened on 7 September 2026.\n\nCall for papers: https://www.
